794	/** One-click WordPress: create the DB, drop WordPress in the webroot, install it
795	 *  as the jailed account user via WP-CLI. Returns the admin login (shown once). */
796	/** Re-check the plan DB cap at DB-creation time. The worker processes tasks
797	 *  SEQUENTIALLY, so this is the serialization point that closes the TOCTOU race
